{"id":"vod_bf_69575","vodId":"69575","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我老婆是学生会长第一季","name_cn":"我老婆是学生会长第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20240611-1/cbd6e28eebf02544b9d9ca9e1594a819.webp"},"summary":"故事发生在星风高中内，和泉隼斗（兴津和幸 配音）信心满满地参加了第一届学生会长的选举，他觉得凭借自己高超的实力，一举夺得学生会长的宝座简直不在话下。就在这个节骨眼上，一位名叫若菜羽衣（竹达彩奈 配音）的女生站在了他的对手席上，而羽衣主持的主张，竟然是荒唐的校园内恋爱自由化，紧接着，羽衣拿出了一大堆安全套，抛向了台下欢呼叫好的同学们。结果可想而知，羽衣当选了。　　就这样，隼斗被迫成为了副会长，辅佐羽衣，然而，令隼斗没有想到的是，羽衣竟然跑到了自己的家里，还宣称自己是他的未婚妻。原来，两人的父母在很早之前就认识了，关系十分要好，两家的孩子就此结下娃娃亲。面对突如其来的学生会长未婚妻，隼斗会怎样应对呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:22:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/wolaoposhixueshenghuichangdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1